OL,3,GNEWSASt Columb's Hall bought with
OL,4,A#3.75m of lottery funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Londonderry's most historic and
OL,7,Fculturally significant buildings is to
OL,8,Fbe "sustainably redeveloped" after it
OL,9,Fwas bought with almost #4m of National
OL,10,FLottery funding.
OL,12,FSt Columb's Hall, a Grade A listed
OL,13,Fbuilding, opened its doors in 1888 but
OL,14,Fits condition has gradually declined
OL,15,Fover recent years and in 2020 it
OL,16,Fstopped hosting events.
OL,18,FIt has now been purchased by the St
OL,19,FColumb's Hall Trust after it was
OL,20,Fawarded #3.75m from The National
OL,21,FLottery Heritage Fund.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
