OL,3,GNEWSASt Columb's Hall bought with
OL,4,A#3.75m of lottery funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnne-Marie Gallagher from the trust
OL,7,Fsaid it had been "a long road" to bring
OL,8,Fthe hall back into community ownership,
OL,9,Fand plans for its redevelopment would
OL,10,Fhonour the legacy of the 138-year-old
OL,11,Fhall.
